cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "readagau: Reproducible Australian Agricultural Data"
type: software
abstract: >
  Provides reproducible access to versioned Australian agricultural
  time-series releases. The package discovers release metadata, reads local
  or cached source assets, returns tidy observations with provenance, and
  supports validation and forecast-vintage comparisons.
authors:
  - family-names: "Macro"
    given-names: "Chartwell"
repository-code: "https://github.com/chartwell-macro/readagau"
url: "https://chartwell-macro.github.io/readagau/"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
keywords:
  - Australia
  - agriculture
  - reproducible research
  - time series
message: >
